---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { baseUrl } from '../utils/base.ts';
---

<Layout
  title="路线图 - UOMP"
  description="UOMP 协议与 Aegis OS memory module 的路线图：原生命令、数据平面、统一审批 UI 与远程 Agent。"
  switchHref={`${baseUrl}en/roadmap/`}
>
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>路线图</h1>
      <p>UOMP 是协议；Aegis OS 是原生实现。</p>

      <div class="roadmap">
        <div class="note">
          <strong>当前焦点：</strong>把 UOMP 完整收口为 Aegis OS 的 memory module——原生命令、原生数据平面、统一审批 UI。
        </div>

        <h2>已完成 <span class="status status-done">Done</span></h2>
        <ul class="roadmap-list">
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>UOMP-Draft-00 规范与 Aegis OS 字段映射</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>Aegis policy / lease / escalation / trusted approval</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>Aegis Memory Gateway：JWT、TLS/mTLS、session check、限流、审计</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>UOMP adapter：Aegis 策略评估 + 可信审批端点</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>Agent 写入 staging 与高敏写入拒绝</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>加密 Payload 上传 / 读取 / 删除</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>远程 Agent device flow 与一次性 remote token</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>统一审批 CLI：<code>aegis-os memory approvals</code></li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span><code>aos-memory-store</code>：UOMP 兼容 SQLite schema + Markdown importer</li>
          <li><span class="status status-done">已完成</span>原生 <code>aegis-os memory status/import/read/list/search</code></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>进行中 <span class="status status-current">In progress</span></h2>
        <ul class="roadmap-list">
          <li><span class="status status-next">下一步</span>Gateway 读路径切到 <code>aos-memory-store</code></li>
          <li><span class="status status-next">下一步</span>Staged writes / payload 元数据迁到 Rust</li>
          <li><span class="status status-next">下一步</span>统一 Web Trusted UI（UOMP + Aegis）</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>后续 <span class="status status-future">Planned</span></h2>
        <ul class="roadmap-list">
          <li><span class="status status-future">之后</span>CSV / JSON connector 与旧 <code>~/.uomp</code> 迁移工具</li>
          <li><span class="status status-future">之后</span>Aegis Cloud 远程 Agent 自动配置</li>
          <li><span class="status status-future">之后</span>独立 daemon / sandbox / 系统密钥库</li>
          <li><span class="status status-future">之后</span>UOMP conformance suite</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>研究 <span class="status status-future">Not scheduled</span></h2>
        <ul class="roadmap-list">
          <li><span class="status status-future">研究</span>FHE（全同态加密）</li>
          <li><span class="status status-future">研究</span>链上审计</li>
          <li><span class="status status-future">研究</span>TEE / 远程 Agent 隔离</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>完成标准</h2>
        <div class="metric-grid">
          <div class="metric"><strong>1</strong><span>用户只安装 Aegis OS</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><strong>0</strong><span>Node 依赖的 memory 命令</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><strong>1</strong><span>统一 trusted UI</span></div>
          <div class="metric"><strong>0</strong><span>同用户 Agent 可直接读数据</span></div>
        </div>
        <p>
          当这四项同时成立，UOMP 才真正成为 Aegis OS 的原生 memory module。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-btns" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <a href={`${baseUrl}try/`} class="btn-h1">通过 Aegis OS 试用 →</a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}spec/`} class="btn-h1">阅读规范 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
